{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20901","headline":"申胡子觱篥歌 · 李贺","name":"申胡子觱篥歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"颜热感君酒，含嚼芦中声。\n花娘篸绥妥，休睡芙蓉屏。\n谁截太平管，列点排空星。\n直贯开花风，天上驱云行。\n今夕岁华落，令人惜平生。\n心事如波涛，中坐时时惊。\n朔客骑白马，剑弝悬兰缨。\n俊健如生猱，肯拾蓬中萤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}